---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing"
  description="Explore Zahari's free sample and the proposed membership for its eight coin worlds."
>
  <section class="pricing-page page-width">
    <p class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE SPACE TO EXPLORE</p>
    <h1>One world, or all eight.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Begin with the free sample. Choose a coin world when paid memberships
      open.
    </p>
    <div class="plan-grid">
      <article class="plan-card">
        <span class="pill">Available now</span>
        <h2>Sample</h2>
        <p class="plan-price">Free</p>
        <p>Explore Zahari before choosing a world.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Interactive sample artwork</li>
          <li>Lowland, Pacific and sky locations</li>
          <li>Dawn, daylight, dusk and night lighting</li>
          <li>Orbit, zoom and save an image</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/" class="button secondary">
          Explore the sample
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="plan-card featured">
        <span class="pill">Proposed membership · not on sale</span>
        <h2>One World</h2>
        <p class="plan-price">
          $6 <span>USD / month · proposed</span>
        </p>
        <p>Stay close to one coin you care about.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Choose one of the eight launch coins</li>
          <li>Its own 3D subject and available model states</li>
          <li>Scene lighting, location and image capture</li>
          <li>Future market-shaped updates and sourced news when launched</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="plan-unavailable">
          Checkout opens when the full experience is ready
        </span>
      </article>
      <article class="plan-card">
        <span class="pill">Proposed membership · not on sale</span>
        <h2>Eight Worlds</h2>
        <p class="plan-price">
          $16 <span>USD / month · proposed</span>
        </p>
        <p>Move between every launch world.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>All eight launch coins and their distinct 3D subjects</li>
          <li>The same lighting, location and image controls</li>
          <li>Future market-shaped updates and sourced news when launched</li>
          <li>One membership, one account</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="plan-unavailable">
          Checkout opens when the full experience is ready
        </span>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="pricing-footnote">
      Launch coins: AAVE, BNB, BTC, ETH, LINK, SOL, UNI and XAUT. Prices and
      paid features are proposals; no card is collected and no subscription can
      be purchased yet. Payment is planned through card checkout.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
